      {
        "id": 220873,
        "name": "lynkfox",
        "username": "lynkfox",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/lynkfox/{size}/1997_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-08-24T13:04:14.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Emails are in backlog, because everyone is in the warehouse shipping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Per the latest kickstarter update if you sent them an email before the 21st of July, it -should- be properly updated. If it isnt, and you did send an email, theyll cover the mistake and correct it as soon as they can.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you didn't, they can ship you another one once your old one comes back as undeliverable, but you'll have to cover shipping.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Your best bet is to contact FedEx, explain that you are expecting a package and it may be getting shipped to your old address. They can look up through the address+your name, and then, assuming it hasn't been shipped yet, put a notice on it to re-lable it to another address. It will be a small charge, but you're far more likely to get it done and fixed this way.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>If you are quick and they haven't shipped it out at all yet, you should be really luckly. If they have shipped it that charge may be a bit more than small, to move that package back across the country :/</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Otherwise, your only bet is to wait and see.</p>",
        "post_number": 4,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T05:53:26.271Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 0,
